 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "The Chick Class Hunter Is Being Filial!"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ko-ro": "병아리반 헌터는 효도 중!"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "In a world where awakened beings with special powers are born through a mysterious system, at Saebom Kindergarten's Chick Class, Groo awakens as an S-rank Hunter at the tender age of 4. Along with that, she receives one important quest...\n\n[Quest: The child needs a reliable guardian!]\n\nThe reason a guardian is needed? Because Groo has no mother or father. \n\nWith no family of her own, Groo is adopted by Korea’s top Hunter after a series of struggles, and on top of that, she developed a new skill.\n\n[Find a new guardian and register them in the slot!]\n\n[Children can earn 'Filial Piety Points' through various activities, which can be used in various areas.]\n\nGathering guardians will lead to quick growth?\n\n\"This is incredible!\"\n\nAlright, I’ll gather all the S-rank guardians!"
  },
